    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83111" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐθοίγια</span></b> , τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>festival at the opening of casks</i> of new wine, held at
			the Anthesteria, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.655e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				735e
			</span></i> :—later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐθοιγία</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1363.26
			</span></i> ; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐθοιγὶς</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠώς</span>, the morning of this festival,
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Aet.</u>
				1.1.1
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πῐθοιγιών</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, ὁ,
			month in which the festival took place, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(8).645
			</span></i> (Peparethus, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κιών</span>
		lapis).</div>
